    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">2021-2022 Targets:

Output 1: Community- based conflict resolution and reconciliation mechanisms are in use and working effectively to resolve conflict:
- Establish (8) new CBRMs and conducting (4) basic training on peace building in (5) villages.
- Conduct One Advance training workshop on peace building, conflict resolution, reconciliation and conflict sensitivity.
- Conduct One training workshop on peace building and conflict mitigation.
- Support of sport teams and trains them on peace building, conflict resolution, peaceful communication and community harmony.
- Open Community Dialogue 

Output 2: Peace dividends for community interdependence and co-existence delivered:
- Conduct (2) Training workshops for 2 youth groups on social entrepreneur.
- Establish of income generation mechanisms for (2) groups (one group for youth and one group for women).

Output 3: Women&#xb4;s organizations, including those representing pastoralist women, empowered to meaningfully participate in local and State- level peace building platforms:
- Construction of one multi- purpose center at one of the targeted villages.
- Construction of one unit classroom at Abu Jaradil Mixed School, Rihad El Baradi Locality.

Output 4: Improved networking, coordination, and learning between local and State level peace building institutions:
- Organizing 4 exchange visits for change- makers from different disciplines.
- Conduct (5 Days) training session on gender sensitive issues.
- Conduct the Peace Building Festival at Rihad El Bardi Locality</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
